   <refbody>    <section>
      <p>This API request includes the following header parameters.</p>
      <ul id="ul_104927158">
         <li>
            <b>Header</b>
            <b>Parameters</b>
            <b>:</b>
         </li>
      </ul>
      <p>The header parameters provide instructions to the API on how to handle the request such as authentication and compressing responses that are over 1KB.</p>
